@baseUrl = http://localhost:5105

### List games
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/games

### One games record (replace 1 with an existing ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/games/1

### List franchises
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/franchises

### One franchises record (replace 1 with an existing ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/franchises/1

### List platforms
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/platforms

### One platforms record (replace 1 with an existing ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/platforms/1

### Temporary franchise insert (after implementing Save/controller)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/franchises
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":0,"name":"Temporary Test Franchise","developer":"Test Developer"}

### Update the temporary franchise; replace 999999 with its returned ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/franchises
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":999999,"name":"Temporary Test Franchise Updated","developer":"Test Developer"}

### Delete ONLY the temporary franchise; replace 999999 with its returned ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/franchises/999999

### Temporary platform insert
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/platforms
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":0,"name":"Temporary Test Platform","manufacturer":"Test Manufacturer"}

### Update the temporary platform; replace 999999 with its returned ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/platforms
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":999999,"name":"Temporary Test Platform Updated","manufacturer":"Test Manufacturer"}

### Delete ONLY the temporary platform; replace 999999 with its returned ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/platforms/999999

### Temporary game insert; replace foreign-key IDs with existing values first
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/games
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":0,"title":"Temporary Test Game","notes":"Remove after testing","releaseYear":2026,"franchiseId":1,"platformId":1}

### Update temporary game; replace 999999 and verify the foreign-key IDs
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/games
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":999999,"title":"Temporary Test Game Updated","notes":"Remove after testing","releaseYear":2026,"franchiseId":1,"platformId":1}

### Delete ONLY the temporary game; replace 999999 with its returned ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/games/999999
